WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
This is only the second floor and there is a third floor

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,600
More to lose there

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,600
Wait until managers eliminate all losses

4
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,000
It's safe if we stay here

5
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:11,740
It’s like opening a blind box

6
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:13,740
No one knows what's behind the door

7
00:00:22,010 --> 00:00:40,210
Let’s go. There’s no Korean team anymore.

8
00:00:40,410 --> 00:00:41,610
As long as you protect me

9
00:00:41,610 --> 00:00:43,410
I was mad at you last night, leader of the action team
